  "changes": [
    "Separate traced Class descriptors from instance prototypes, retaining declaration-owned annotation and partial-initialization state.",
    "Canonical builtin Class identity and superclass traversal shared by getClass, metadata, type checks, converters, diagnostics, equality and hashing.",
    "Resolve all 56 pinned base Class declarations, including five additional ordinary Class defaults; external renderer algorithms remain unsupported.",
    "Dereference the Class descriptor prototype when collecting typed equality/hash members in child-first declaration order.",
    "Retain stale/foreign-handle, cancellation and terminal-zero checks with exact descriptor ownership counts.",
    "Add Java-authority-backed native/Node/Chromium comparison and integrity tooling; retain required unexecuted public API boundaries."
